t=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eda60d647d32c2fb83b49f6ac022d6e6, https://si.imgix.net/37449ab2/uploads/origins/05e945bc-7681-4572-9d0c-41517a7e84ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dfc1c9018f809fd36092ca7980079ec6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37449ab2/uploads/origins/05e945bc-7681-4572-9d0c-41517a7e84ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f1a5a9501cbef59ee5a811f15e77e45c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! The request I asked for last time was perfect. I would like to make a cover of this song : https://youtu.be/loWA5o1RdTY?si=z1f6VxUBZA0p5jaZ\n\nI would like an illustration for it, my character is in the reference url.\nShe has mint green hair and rainbow bangs. 2 strands of hair framing her face (one purple on the left side and one pink pastel on the right side). She has hazel beige eyes, they are even yellow if they glow.\n\nI want my character to have the outfit in the drive link. It's the outfit of Hyacine from HonkaiStarRail. Please keep my hair untied.\nI would like for her to have a determined look, but still happy and being very confident in herself. You can change the expression to fit the drawing ! I would like for her to have wings like in the image. The pose is up to you.\nI would like to have a closed eyes and an open eyes version of it.\n\nI would like to have a transparent file, for the format I would like for the canva to not be cropped for it to fit the video, Thank you~\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WkS3mkh4pGg94CC8Po2-ukIEnb3iIOjC?usp=drive_link", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@dayosink/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2819928, "client_id": 1590590, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60585e630aef1ae5d0e32ed47ca3f088", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60585e630aef1ae5d0e32ed47ca3f088, https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90fe0e50ba8b13f7a62d9144736e8168 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8cf891f93876228c682b8950a6123b6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2daa1473b5bd322053764becb187eb55", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2daa1473b5bd322053764becb187eb55, https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=961c82f2837c9241b358d91ba568c9e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f209bc77/uploads/origins/faeb8255-45fe-4913-962e-70a02df9d18a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f071b9bc86b1d1450cf34a14ab3498f 3x"}, "body": "初めまして、個人VTuberのG.I.N(ギン)と申します。\n突然のご連絡失礼いたします。\n\n惰世様の描くイラストがとても素敵で\nこの度Skebのご依頼をさせていただきたくご連絡を差し上げました。\n\n【ご依頼したいイラストについて】\nキャラクターの資料を添付させていただきます。\n色んな衣装がフォルダにおいてありますが、今回「メイド」の資料を参考に\nメイド服、白髪の衣装にて、「メイドの寝起きっぽい」イラストを希望しております。\n\n人間とドラゴンの二つの姿がありますが、ドラゴン間の姿にてよろしくお願いします。\n\nもし可能でございましたら配信サムネイル等に使用させて頂けたらと考えておりますので\n左右どちらかが切れてないキャラクター単品のデータもいただけたら嬉しいです…！\n\n▼資料（キャラクター参考資料と3面図を参考にしていただけたらと思います。）\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ei-3O3ZIajYuxEzaMQKkiCURS2Cyr5iN?usp=sharing\n\n【納品形式について】\nPSD形式で、「人物」と「それ以外の要素」にレイヤーが分かれているようにお願いできますと幸いです。\n\n【使用用途について】\nSNSや動画配信サイトなどの活動サイト上でのプロモーション活動への利用。\n\nご検討の程、何卒よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ei-3O3ZIajYuxEzaMQKkiCURS2Cyr5iN?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@dayosink/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2819928, "client_id": 1182972, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39c11439382c139772336be09abb75a6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39c11439382c139772336be09abb75a6, https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73cee2e96501c7f368a954c2657d803e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6f476b20085395d175050a587fec2dd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=069b8c4797e6df118127fa2977371f75", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=069b8c4797e6df118127fa2977371f75, https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7f4122adb4f25b78a9662eb9f78a4ddc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b8036d3a/uploads/origins/79f353ba-b910-48d9-bbc6-e4f311abb571?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c51394e18831e9881f364764c667116 3x"}, "body": "Hello!! I love your art and would like to request a drawing. I would like to make a cover of this song : https://youtu.be/aPyt41nnM0k?si=JswV6ZLWpeuQlb6X\n\nI would like an illustration for the video!\nHere is my character called Reiru : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oaXwKlT5Mm2bInySCPaGBgKf0uzuZcVK\n\nShe has mint green hair with rainbow bangs. 2 strands of hair are framing her face (one purple on the left side of her face and one pink pastel on the right side). She has hazel beige eyes, they are even yellow if they glow.\n\nI want my character to have this outfit : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mKK20YG6wEJyW8sRLQvPQs8UDU5zrz2e?usp=sharing\nIt's the outfit of Robin from Honkai Star Rail.\n\nI would like for her to look like she is singing, you can draw whatever you think will fit the song. :D\n\nI would like to have a transparant file too if possible, and for the format of the drawing to be like this one : https://skeb.jp/@dayosink/works/9 for it to fit the video ! Thank you ~", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@dayosink/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2819928, "client_id": 643155, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42ea471c/uploads/origins/5e4fb967-440b-4a21-99ef-6f5997b694a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1e8a2fd8a9b130794e555ef8ebe4806", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42ea471c/uploads/origins/5e4fb967-440b-4a21-99ef-6f5997b694a5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres